Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://vajra-os.org

Package: vajra-update-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, apt, dpkg
Recommends: timeshift, unattended-upgrades
Description: Vajra OS Update Manager — check, install, rollback with snapshots
 Update manager for Vajra OS with pre-update snapshots and rollback support.
 .
 Features:
  * Check for available updates
  * Install updates with automatic pre-update snapshot
  * Rollback to previous state from snapshot
  * Kernel-specific update support
  * Update history log
  * Automatic update configuration (security or full)
  * System cleanup (unused packages, cache, logs)
  * Manual snapshot creation
